// Commands — server→agent dispatch over the Stream downlink. W1-5 mints and
// sends commands; W3-3 adds per-action capability tokens that gate which
// commands an agent may execute.
//
// Capability tokens (W3-3): every dispatched action carries a short-lived
// capability token (capability_token, a compact JWT signed ES256 by the org
// root CA — the same trust anchor the agent pins from enroll). A token is
